<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners net sellers of S.Africa bonds last week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net sellers of S.Africa bonds last week.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net sellers of 12.67 million rand worth of South African bonds last week, latest Bond Exchange of South Africa figures show.</p>
<p>Non-resident transactions (million rand):</p>
<p>				   Week to Dec 27   Year to date</p>
<p>    - purchases		     169.27	173,531.32</p>
<p>    - sales			   181.94	170,231.06</p>
<p>    - net purchases (sales)     (12.67)     3,300.26</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
